# Non-normative. @ marks a nonterminal. Empty RHS means epsilon.
# Sections replace earlier definitions of the same nonterminal.
# Check.lean derives the Head, Body and Const expression ladders
# and the ExprContinuation and MatchEnd operator branches from shared precedence rules.
# See README.md for provenance, alternatives and the checker command.
